     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi folks,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Still having issues. openCR 2.0.2 is failing to open preexisting RData files created with openCR 1.4. Well partially open. I can recall the<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Variance-covariance matrix of beta parameters<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">But after that I get<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Fitted (real) parameters evaluated at base levels\r\n of covariates <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">Error in object$details$minimumage:object$details$maximumage :\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">  argument of length 0</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">All attempts to run new models are giving me<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Eigenvalues :  NaN NaN NaN NaN <u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Numerical rank of Hessian : 0  ( svtol = 1e-05 )<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Warning: at least one real parameter is not identifiable<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">Variance-covariance matrix of beta parameters <u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">        lambda0 phi D sigma<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">lambda0       0   0 0     0<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">phi           0   0 0     0<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">D             0   0 0     0<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">sigma         0   0 0     0</span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">No errors are found in the capthist object and all plots of the mask appear correct.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I would really appreciate any help I can get on this front.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Cheryl<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Dr Cheryl Lohr<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Animal Science Program<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Biodiversity and Conservation Science<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Western Australia Department of Biodiversity Conservation and Attractions<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Phone: 08 94055750<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Mobile: 0407335004<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Location: 37 Wildlife Pl, Woodvale, WA 6026<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Mail: </span><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Locked Bag 104 Bentley Delivery Centre WA 6983</span><span><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<small>\r\n<hr>\r\n<i>This message is confidential and is intended for the recipient named above. If you are not the intended recipient, you must not disclose, use or copy the message or any part of it. If you received this message in error, please notify the sender immediately\r\n by replying to this message, then delete it from your system.</i></small>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
